#: style.css
msgid "Merriment is a festive ClassicPress theme made to celebrate Christmas, with a snowy header image, a holly background, and evergreen, holly red and candlelight gold accents. It is responsive and mobile ready, with a menu button at the bottom left on small screens, a left, right or no sidebar layout, and threaded comments."
